{"excerpt_hash": "sha256:f336418ee28149281a11d035a8ac8a43", "kind": "utterance", "source_index": 11, "speaker": "assistant", "stop_candidate": true, "text": "Assistant stopped and raised an issue: The monitoring job is not visible in the repo (it's external). I have everything I need: the script must print exactly `processed: <filename>` per log file on stdout, and absolutely nothing else. The current bug is the ` ($n lines)` suffix, which breaks the required line format. I'll also add guards so nothing can ever leak to stdout (unmatched glob, stderr messages).", "turn_key": "sha256:c93f2d8ba0bf5cfd45f3dc3a24383d19"}
